WEBVTT

00:00:59.974 --> 00:01:02.367
[1: Talk about it.]

00:01:02.391 --> 00:01:05.492
You can't do it alone.
And that's when your squad has to come in.

00:01:05.516 --> 00:01:06.784
It's taboo.

00:01:06.808 --> 00:01:09.950
We typically don't talk about our stresses
when it comes to money.

00:01:09.974 --> 00:01:12.200
We need to come together
as a group of friends,

00:01:12.224 --> 00:01:13.659
no judgment, no shame.

00:01:13.683 --> 00:01:16.659
Celebrate the fact
that we've made a decision

00:01:16.683 --> 00:01:19.242
that we want to have
a better relationship with money.

00:01:19.266 --> 00:01:21.909
That is worth applauding
or snapping your fingers about.

00:01:21.933 --> 00:01:24.367
Once you've done that, then you get real.

00:01:24.391 --> 00:01:26.492
Nothing should be off-limits.

00:01:26.516 --> 00:01:28.409
Where does this relationship come from?

00:01:28.433 --> 00:01:33.323
Why am I spending all this money
on things that don't align with my goals?